    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d341">

                <pb facs="0272" n="222" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav03/pg222"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.77/297a</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-02-19T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                                1918, 5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department has approved Stevens’s plan to return to Harbin with Emerson and
                    party. Please inform him fully regarding Siberian situation and attitude of this
                    Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
